# C is ls.active, A the inner ring, B the outer ring, W up. The inner ring
# leaves before the outer one comes, and the other way round. On the way out
# ls.active goes first, then the ring, then the direction. The flick at 500
# goes straight to the outer ring: A never goes down.
+C@0 +A@0 +W@0
-A@100 +B@100
-B@300 +A@300
-C@400 -A@400 -W@400
+C@500 +B@500 +W@500
-C@600 -B@600 -W@600
